  "notes": "8 XLR/6.35 mm TRS combo inputs (2 front, 6 rear); LINE/INST switching applies to the front inputs 1-2. MAIN OUT and LINE OUT 3-10 are balanced 6.35 mm TRS; LINE OUT levels are controlled only by the DAW. Two stereo headphone outputs. OPT I/O switch: S/PDIF mode (optical in = ch 9-10) or ADAT mode (optical in = ch 11-18, out = 13-20; coax S/PDIF in 9-10, out 11-12). MIDI IN/OUT 5-pin DIN, USB type B, external power adapter (not listed).",
